*E_NAME		"Pillai Guard"

*E_CHAT		"The path ends here. If you want to  go to the forest, you can use the   Warp Gate in the south of the city."
*E_CHAT		"Behind me, there is the Warp Gate   that teleports you everywhere. You  need to a wing to use the Warp Gate."
*E_CHAT		"If you need to make a wing, or      upgrade your old one, you can use   the warp now to visit the inventor  of the Warp Gate in Ricarten."
*E_CHAT		"Teleportation is free for Ricarten  and Pillai. You need a wing for gainaccess to other areas."